<h1 style="color: #5e9ca0;"><span style="color: #000080;">NeedIt Scripted API</span></h1>
The NeedIt Scripted API provides methods for interacting with data from the NeedIt application including:
<ul>
<li>GET ni_getinfo: Get aggregate (count) information for records for a specific user from the NeedIt table.</li>
<li>GET ni_getinfo(v2): Has all the same features as v1 but also includes a custom error message if the request passes an invalid user name.</li>
</ul>

